  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Access to Finance Scoping, Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to:&#x2022;	Gain a better understanding of the agro-financing ecosystem in Nigeria.&#x2022;	Formulate possible access to finance interventions within the Dutch Food and Nutrition Security (FNS), Private Sector Development (PSD) and agribusiness interventions.&#x2022;	Enhance Dutch and Nigerian partnerships in agri-finance, trade and investment. &#x2022;	Suggest policy and regulatory interventions supporting agricultural development, trade and investment in agri-food. &#x2022;	Increase interest in Dutch financial and allied institutions and organisations in Nigeria. The information provided will assist stakeholders in making a clear decision based on the insights gathered on potential leverage points that could enhance inclusive and innovative financial solutions that fit Nigerian agricultural sectors&apos; needs and ambitions.</narrative>
  </description>
